   "text": "Contiguous (illustrative): 12 used / 32 cells = 37.5% useful\nMeasured on older systems (paper): only 20.4-38.2% of KV memory held real token states\nPaged: waste only in each sequence's last partial block -> under 4%",
   "originalText": "Contiguous (illustrative): 12 used / 32 cells = 37.5% useful\nMeasured on older systems (paper): only 20.4-38.2% of KV memory held real token states\nPaged: waste only in each sequence's last partial block -> under 4%",
