   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Small block: tiny waste, but big tables, poor memory-access efficiency, fine sharing granularity.\nLarge block: more waste in the last block and coarser prefix sharing. 16 is the vLLM default.",
   "originalText": "Small block: tiny waste, but big tables, poor memory-access efficiency, fine sharing granularity.\nLarge block: more waste in the last block and coarser prefix sharing. 16 is the vLLM default.",
