   "text": "s_j   = q K_j^T / sqrt(d_h)         q:[32,128]  K_j:[16,8,128]  s_j:[32,16]  (q head h reads kv head h//4)\nm_j   = max(m_{j-1}, rowmax s_j)   l_j = l_{j-1}*e^(m_{j-1}-m_j) + sum e^(s_j-m_j)\nacc_j = acc_{j-1}*e^(m_{j-1}-m_j) + e^(s_j-m_j) V_j      V_j:[16,8,128]\no     = acc / l                                          o:[32,128]",
   "originalText": "s_j   = q K_j^T / sqrt(d_h)         q:[32,128]  K_j:[16,8,128]  s_j:[32,16]  (q head h reads kv head h//4)\nm_j   = max(m_{j-1}, rowmax s_j)   l_j = l_{j-1}*e^(m_{j-1}-m_j) + sum e^(s_j-m_j)\nacc_j = acc_{j-1}*e^(m_{j-1}-m_j) + e^(s_j-m_j) V_j      V_j:[16,8,128]\no     = acc / l                                          o:[32,128]",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e439",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e441",
