   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "no sharing : 1000 x 125 blocks x 2 MiB = 250,000 MiB ~ 244 GiB of identical K/V\nshared     : 125 x 2 MiB = 250 MiB once (+ small private tails)\nprefill    : the 2,000 prompt tokens are skipped for users 2..1000 -> TTFT = private suffix only",
   "originalText": "no sharing : 1000 x 125 blocks x 2 MiB = 250,000 MiB ~ 244 GiB of identical K/V\nshared     : 125 x 2 MiB = 250 MiB once (+ small private tails)\nprefill    : the 2,000 prompt tokens are skipped for users 2..1000 -> TTFT = private suffix only",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e612",
