   "text": "Only FULL blocks are hashed. Chained hash => a hit means identical prefix AND position.\nBlocks with ref=0 stay cached and are evicted LRU when the pool needs space.",
   "originalText": "Only FULL blocks are hashed. Chained hash => a hit means identical prefix AND position.\nBlocks with ref=0 stay cached and are evicted LRU when the pool needs space.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
