   "text": "One changed token early (e.g. a timestamp in the system prompt) breaks the chain\nfor every block after it -> zero reuse. Keep the shared part first and byte-identical.",
   "originalText": "One changed token early (e.g. a timestamp in the system prompt) breaks the chain\nfor every block after it -> zero reuse. Keep the shared part first and byte-identical.",
