   "text": "SWAP\nGPU blocks -> CPU RAM (swap_space) over PCIe\n1 GiB seq @ ~25 GB/s ~ 43 ms out, again to resume\nno recompute; costs CPU memory + PCIe time",
   "originalText": "SWAP\nGPU blocks -> CPU RAM (swap_space) over PCIe\n1 GiB seq @ ~25 GB/s ~ 43 ms out, again to resume\nno recompute; costs CPU memory + PCIe time",
