   "text": "Paper: recompute cost is flat across block sizes; swap suffers with small blocks\n(many tiny PCIe copies). At block sizes 16-64 the two are comparable.",
   "originalText": "Paper: recompute cost is flat across block sizes; swap suffers with small blocks\n(many tiny PCIe copies). At block sizes 16-64 the two are comparable.",
