   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KV pool budget on a 40 GB A100, Llama-3-8B BF16:\n0.9 x 40 = 36 GB - 16 GB weights - ~2 GB activations ~ 18 GB for KV\n18 GB = 16.8 GiB / 2 MiB = ~8,580 blocks = ~137K tokens (fp8: ~17,160 blocks = ~274K tokens)",
   "originalText": "KV pool budget on a 40 GB A100, Llama-3-8B BF16:\n0.9 x 40 = 36 GB - 16 GB weights - ~2 GB activations ~ 18 GB for KV\n18 GB = 16.8 GiB / 2 MiB = ~8,580 blocks = ~137K tokens (fp8: ~17,160 blocks = ~274K tokens)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e718",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
